D7AF]span wire, and emit one LSP semantic token per segment.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Publish a sase-core-rs release containing the matcher change[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-release[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-release: land the release-plz version bump for sase-core, record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the published version, and confirm the wheel resolves from PyPI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Consume segments in ACE, guard the floor, and correct the docs[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]python[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-release[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]python: move the sase-core-rs window, carry span segments through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]facade into the prompt highlight map, normalize wrapped matched text in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the preview card, add a published-minimum smoke gate, and fix the docs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that promise line-local matching.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ik","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-ik.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-510efbbf8e702251304d8ec412b84706","started_at":"2026-08-09T19:58:54.369107+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-ik","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ik.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ik.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ik.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ik.land"]}
